1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,333
Remember the special, shiny stones?

2
00:00:02,653 --> 00:00:04,296
They're called Spirit Stones.

3
00:00:04,616 --> 00:00:07,218
They're powerful, and they also end the game.

4
00:00:08,233 --> 00:00:10,387
Here is a Spirit Stone, in the bowl.

5
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,443
A Spirit Stone can't go in the normal circles.

6
00:00:14,763 --> 00:00:18,966
It only goes on the space marked times two, next to the animal's name.

7
00:00:20,066 --> 00:00:22,242
Ana's Turtle has four red stones.

8
00:00:22,562 --> 00:00:23,800
That's nine points.

9
00:00:25,349 --> 00:00:26,971
She adds a Spirit Stone.

10
00:00:27,291 --> 00:00:28,741
Times two means double.

11
00:00:29,061 --> 00:00:30,512
Nine becomes eighteen!

12
00:00:31,633 --> 00:00:33,574
But now this animal is closed.

13
00:00:33,894 --> 00:00:36,369
Closed means no more stones can go on it.

14
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:40,678
So wait until the animal is full, or nearly full.

15
00:00:41,799 --> 00:00:44,615
Spirit Stones also tell you when the game ends.

16
00:00:44,936 --> 00:00:46,045
Look at the bag.

17
00:00:46,365 --> 00:00:50,311
These five circles count the Spirit Stones that are out of the bag.

18
00:00:51,433 --> 00:00:54,206
Out of the bag means in the bowl, or on a board.

19
00:00:56,283 --> 00:00:59,419
When the fifth one comes out, all five circles are full.

20
00:00:59,739 --> 00:01:02,171
At the end of that turn, the game is over.

21
00:01:03,299 --> 00:01:05,347
Now everyone adds up their points.

22
00:01:05,667 --> 00:01:07,694
The player with the most points wins!

23
00:01:08,799 --> 00:01:10,997
What if both players have the same points?

24
00:01:11,317 --> 00:01:12,341
That's a tie.

25
00:01:12,661 --> 00:01:15,285
Then the player with the Coyote on their board wins.

26
00:01:16,399 --> 00:01:17,295
Remember.

27
00:01:17,615 --> 00:01:21,669
A Spirit Stone goes on a times two space, and doubles that animal.

28
00:01:21,989 --> 00:01:23,717
Then that animal is closed.

29
00:01:24,037 --> 00:01:27,429
When five Spirit Stones are out of the bag, the game ends.

30
00:01:27,749 --> 00:01:29,157
The most points wins.

31
00:01:29,477 --> 00:01:31,567
Next: the six Spirit Powers.
